{"version":1,"title":"[語言進階]C7 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">文章</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/2026-2027-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/\">2026 - 2027 學年</a> <span class=\"sep\"></span> <a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/2026-2027-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/%E8%AA%9E%E8%A8%80%E9%80%B2%E9%9A%8E/\">語言進階</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">1986 字 · 约 7 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-09T02:47:51.000Z\">2026-11-09</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-11-09T13:44:42.001Z\">2026-11-09</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[語言進階]C7</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><h2 id=\"变长数组\">变长数组</h2>\n<p>VLA。</p>\n<p><code>T[M]</code>，其元素类型是 <code>T</code>，元素个数是表达式 <code>M</code>。</p>\n<p><code>M</code> 不是一个<a href=\"https://samuflore.top/posts/f95facb6/#%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E5%B8%B8%E9%87%8F\">整数常量</a>或者<a href=\"#%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E5%B8%B8%E9%87%8F%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F\">整数常量表达式</a>。</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>数组长度：<code>M</code> 的右值 * <code>sizeof(T)</code> 必须在运行时才能确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>首次执行到 <code>T[M]</code> 时数组大小确定，之后不能被修改。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>例：<code>int a[m][m]</code> 一位数组，大小为 <code>m</code>，元素类型 <code>int[m]</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从-sizeof-角度看\">从 <code>sizeof</code> 角度看</h3>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>sizeof(type-name)</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果 type-name 是 Non-VLA，则编译时得到 type-name 的大小，该表达式返回值是整数常量。不对 type-name 中的子表达式进行 Evaluate。</p>\n<p>如果是 VLA，则运行时得到 type-name 的大小，该表达式返回值不是整数常量。需要对 type-name 中的子表达式进行 Evaluate。</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>sizeof(lvalue)</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果左值定位对象是 Non-VLA，则编译时得到定位对象的大小，该表达式返回值是整数常量。不对左值 Evaluate。</p>\n<p>如果是 VLA，则运行时得到定位对象的大小，该表达式返回值不是整数常量。需要对子表达式进行 Evaluate。</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>sizeof(non-lvalue)</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>sizeof</code> 表达式返回这个 non-lvalue 做 Evaluate 之后的右值类型的大小，但 non-lvalue 不会真的做 Evaluate。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常量表达式\">常量表达式</h2>\n<p>常量表达式能在编译时进行 Evaluate，像常量一样使用</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>不能包含赋值、自增/自减、函数调用、逗号运算符，除非<strong>他们包含在不被 Evaluate 的子表达中</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>常量表达式 Evaluate 后的右值的取值范围应当在表达式右值类型的表征范围内。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"整数常量表达式\">整数常量表达式</h3>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>C23 新增关键字 <code>constexpr</code>：</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"type\">int</span> n = <span class=\"number\">10</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"type\">float</span> f = <span class=\"number\">1.0</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">typedef</span> <span class=\"class\"><span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> <span class=\"title\">str</span> {</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">int</span> a;</span><br><span class=\"line\">} STR;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">constexpr</span> STR x = {<span class=\"number\">10</span>};</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>这时 <code>n</code> <code>f</code> <code>x</code> 都是常量表达式，被称作 named constant。</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>枚举中的枚举常量也是 named constant</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>true</code> <code>false</code> <code>nullptr</code> 也是 named constant</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>被 <code>constexpr</code> 修饰的<a href=\"https://samuflore.top/posts/eea4d95f/#%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%88%E5%AD%97%E9%9D%A2%E9%87%8F\">复合字面量</a>被称作 Compound Literal Constant。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">typedef</span> <span class=\"class\"><span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> <span class=\"title\">str</span> {</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">int</span> a;</span><br><span class=\"line\">} STR;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">(<span class=\"type\">constexpr</span> STR) {<span class=\"number\">10</span>};</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>满足以下要求的是整数常量表达式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>表达式右值类型是整数类型。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>操作数是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-7\">整数常量</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-7\">字符常量</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-7\">类型为整数的 named constant</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-7\">类型为整数的 compound literal constant</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-7\">右值类型是整数常量的 <code>sizeof</code> 表达式</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-7\"><code>alignof</code> 表达式</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-7\">强制类型转换表达式，其中操作数是浮点常量、类型为算术类型的 named constant、compound literal constant，除非该强制类型转换表达式是 <code>typeof</code> <code>sizeof</code> <code>alignof</code> 的操作数</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"size-padding-alignment\">size, padding &amp; alignment</h2>\n<h3 id=\"对齐\">对齐</h3>\n<p>一个类型按照 alignment 对齐，即：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mspace></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\mathrm{Address} \\mod \\; \\; \\mathrm{Alignment} = 0\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Address</span></span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Alignment</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>使用 <code>alignof(T) / _Alignof</code> 获得类型 <code>T</code> 的对齐要求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"填充\">填充</h3>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>alignas / _Alignas</code> 指定对齐：<code>alignas(N) T O / _Alignas(N) T O</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>声明一个 <code>T</code> 类型对象 <code>O</code>，要求其按照 <code>N</code> 字节对齐。</p>\n<h4 id=\"结构体类型的对齐要求\">结构体类型的对齐要求</h4>\n<p>如果 <code>T</code> 是结构体类型，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 个成员对象分别是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\mathrm{\\_Alignof}(T) = \\max\\{\\mathrm{\\_Alignof}(E_i), \\; 1&lt;i \\le N\\}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.07778em;\">_Alignof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.07778em;\">_Alignof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7955em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>使用 <code>alignas</code> 修改结构体对象的对齐要求：</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">alignas</span>(<span class=\"number\">64</span>) <span class=\"class\"><span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> <span class=\"title\">stru</span> {</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">char</span> a;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">alignas</span>(<span class=\"number\">32</span>) <span class=\"type\">short</span> b;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">int</span> c[<span class=\"number\">10</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">double</span> d;</span><br><span class=\"line\">} s;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"结构体类型的大小计算\">结构体类型的大小计算</h4>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>结构体第 1 个成员对象的首地址就是结构体的首地址，地址偏移量 <code>offset</code> 为 0</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>结构体第 i 个成员对象的地址偏移量计算前，先按照对齐要求补齐第 i - 1 个成员所需的 padding</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>则 <code>struct stru</code> 的对齐要求是 <strong>32 字节对齐</strong>，而 <code>s</code> 的对齐要求是 <strong>64 字节对齐要求</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"pragma-pack-n\"><code>#pragma pack(n)</code></h4>\n<p>使用 <code>#pragma pack(n)</code> 可以强制改变结构体的对齐要求，具体规则如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>如果 <code>T</code> 是结构体类型，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 个成员对象分别是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\mathrm{\\_Alignof}(E_i) = \\min\\{\\mathrm{\\_Alignof}(E_i), n\\}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.07778em;\">_Alignof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.07778em;\">_Alignof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>_Alignof(T)</code> 规则不变</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>即将所有成员的对齐要求改为<strong>最大为 n 字节对齐</strong>。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#<span class=\"keyword\">pragma</span> pack(1)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">alignas</span>(<span class=\"number\">64</span>) <span class=\"class\"><span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> <span class=\"title\">stru</span> {</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">char</span> a;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">alignas</span>(<span class=\"number\">32</span>) <span class=\"type\">short</span> b;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">int</span> c[<span class=\"number\">10</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">double</span> d;</span><br><span class=\"line\">} s;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p><code>alignof(s.a/s.b/s.c/s.d/struct stru) = 1</code> 但 <code>alignof(s) = 64</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"malloc-aligned-alloc-与内存对齐\"><code>malloc</code> <code>aligned_alloc</code> 与内存对齐</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#<span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <span class=\"string\">&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> *p = (<span class=\"type\">int</span> *)<span class=\"built_in\">malloc</span>(<span class=\"keyword\">sizeof</span>(<span class=\"type\">int</span>));</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>标准库中 <code>malloc</code> 会返回满足基础对齐要求的存储空间。如果需要获得指定对齐要求的存储空间，需要使用 <code>aligned_alloc</code>。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">void</span> *<span class=\"title function_\">aligned_alloc</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">size_t</span> alignment, <span class=\"type\">size_t</span> size)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>强制类型转换的对齐风险</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>考虑：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">char</span> a[<span class=\"number\">10</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> *p = (<span class=\"type\">int</span> *)(a + <span class=\"number\">1</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p><code>a</code> 的首地址 % 2 == 0，则 <code>(int *)(a + 1)</code> 是 UB。</p>\n<p><code>a</code> 的首地址 % 2 == 0 但 % 4 != 0，则 <code>(int *)a</code> 是 UB。</p>\n<h2 id=\"函数形参中的限定符\">函数形参中的限定符</h2>\n<h3 id=\"const\"><code>const</code></h3>\n<p><code>const</code> 可以用于传递数组对象，如：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">void</span> <span class=\"title function_\">func</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">char</span> <span class=\"type\">const</span> *p, <span class=\"type\">int</span> n)</span> {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"type\">int</span> i = <span class=\"number\">0</span>; i &lt; n; i++) {</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">printf</span>(<span class=\"string\">\"%c\"</span>, *(p + i));</span><br><span class=\"line\">    }</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">void</span>)</span> {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">char</span> e[<span class=\"number\">2</span>] = {<span class=\"string\">'a'</span>, <span class=\"string\">'b'</span>};</span><br><span class=\"line\">    func(e, <span class=\"number\">2</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"restrict\"><code>restrict</code></h3>\n<p>修饰指针类型：<code>T*</code> <code>restrict</code> <code>O</code> <code>=</code> initializer。</p>\n<p><code>restrict</code> 限制一块内存只能有一个入口。如果两个指针定位同一个对象，并同时试图进行修改，将导致 UB：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> <span class=\"title function_\">foo</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">int</span>* <span class=\"keyword\">restrict</span> p, <span class=\"type\">int</span>* <span class=\"keyword\">restrict</span> q)</span> {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *p = <span class=\"number\">10</span>; *q = <span class=\"number\">20</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> (*p + *q);</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">void</span>)</span> {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">int</span> a = <span class=\"number\">10</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">printf</span>(<span class=\"string\">\"%d\\n\"</span>, foo(&amp;a, &amp;a));</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"存储期\">存储期</h2>\n<p>静态存储期、自动存储期参考<a href=\"https://samuflore.top/posts/d6b2cc32/#%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%9C%9F\">此处</a>。</p>\n<p><code>malloc</code> 分配的内存具有分配存储期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"作用域、命名空间和链接属性\">作用域、命名空间和链接属性</h2>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><ruby>作用域<rt>Scope</rt></ruby></p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-2\">\n<li class=\"lvl-6\">File Scope：通常是全局变量或函数</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-6\">Block Scope：<code>{}</code> 内或函数参数列表中的标识符</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-6\">Function Scope：仅用于标签</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-6\">Function Prototype Scope：仅用于函数声明的参数名</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><ruby>命名空间<rt>Name Space</rt></ruby></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"md-table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Name Space</th>\n<th>包含的标识符</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Label</td>\n<td>goto 使用的标签</td>\n<td>start:</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tag</td>\n<td>struct、union、enum 的标签</td>\n<td>struct foo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Structure/Union Member</td>\n<td>结构体、联合体成员名</td>\n<td>s.value</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Standard Attribute</td>\n<td>标准属性及属性前缀</td>\n<td>C23 属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attribute Name</td>\n<td>带属性前缀的属性名</td>\n<td>C23 属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ordinary Identifier</td>\n<td>普通标识符，包括变量名、函数名、typedef 名、枚举常量等</td>\n<td>int a、typedef int T</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><ruby>链接属性<rt>Linkage</rt></ruby>：决定多个声明中的同名标识符是否指向同一个实体</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-2\">\n<li class=\"lvl-6\">internal：拥有 File Scope，且被 <code>static</code> 或 <code>constexpr</code> 修饰的标识符。其他编译单元无法使用 internal linkage 的标识符。</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-6\">none：只在声明它的 Scope 内有效。</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-6\">external：在整个程序的所有编译单元中引用同一个实体</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><ruby>暂定定义<rt>Tentative Defination</rt></ruby>：<strong>File Scope 下</strong>，没有初始化器，没有 extern 或 thread_local 的定义，多个暂定定义会合并为一个对象定义：</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> a;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> a;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">int</span> argc, <span class=\"type\">char</span> *argv[])</span> {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"算术类型转换\">算术类型转换</h2>\n<h3 id=\"整数转换等级\">整数转换等级</h3>\n<p><code>long long</code> &gt; <code>long</code> &gt; <code>int</code> &gt; <code>short</code> &gt; <code>char</code> &gt; <code>bool</code></p>\n<p>其中<strong>同一整数类型的有符号版本和无符号版本具有相同等级</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"整型提升\">整型提升</h3>\n<p>对于等级低于 <code>int</code> 的类型，在参与运算时，按以下规则提升等级（依次满足）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>两个操作数<strong>都是有符号或者都是无符号</strong>，则低等级向高等级提升</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><strong>无符号操作数的等级大于等于另一个有符号操作数</strong>，则有符号转为无符号</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>有符号类型能覆盖另一个无符号类型，则无符号转为有符号</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>两个操作数都转成有符号对应的无符号类型</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"type\">int</span> a = <span class=\"number\">1</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> b = <span class=\"number\">-1</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (a &gt; b) { <span class=\"built_in\">printf</span>(<span class=\"string\">\"hello\"</span>); }</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>答案是不会 <code>printf</code>，因 <code>b</code> 会整型提升到 <code>unsigned int</code>。但如果：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"type\">int</span> a = <span class=\"number\">1</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">long</span> <span class=\"type\">int</span> b = <span class=\"number\">-1</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (a &gt; b) { <span class=\"built_in\">printf</span>(<span class=\"string\">\"hello\"</span>); }</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>则会 <code>printf</code>，因 <code>long int</code> 等级高于 <code>unsigned int</code>。</p>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}